Package: pipeworks
Title: Visual Editor for 'targets' Pipelines
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Tobias", "Heidler", , "git.tobias@heidler.ovh", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Shows a 'targets' pipeline as a wiring diagram. Each file in R/
    is a block, and the roxygen documentation of each target's function is
    the primary source of information. Also supports quality assurance: a
    second person records a verdict per function, target and other code item,
    the verdicts are kept as files in the repository, 'qa_check()' gates a
    CI job on them, and 'qa_report()' renders a PDF. Started from the R
    console, so 'RStudio' stays the main editor.
